:name: nRF52840 DK
:description: Runs a Zephyr ELF on Renode's nRF52840 model, with the DK's sw0 and led0.
:
: $elf has to be set before this script is included, as an absolute path. The script
: does not start the emulation, so button_led.robot can attach its testers first. By
: hand, from apps/11-renode-test:
:
:   renode --console --disable-xwt -e "\$elf=@$PWD/build/zephyr/zephyr.elf; include @run_nrf52.resc; start"
:
: Renode ships platforms/boards/nrf52840dk_nrf52840.repl, and it is not used here. Its
: buttons have no `invert: true`, so pin 11 reads low at rest. The DK's buttons are
: active low, which makes the firmware see sw0 as held down from boot. The button and
: LED below are wired the way the DK is.

set platform
"""
using "platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl"

gpio0:
    13 -> led0@0

led0: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpio0 13
    invert: true

sw0: Miscellaneous.Button @ gpio0 11
    invert: true
    -> gpio0@11
"""

mach create "nrf52840"
machine LoadPlatformDescriptionFromString $platform

showAnalyzer sysbus.uart0

sysbus LoadELF $elf
